ior  C  representative section of nipple and mass beneath it  nipple mobile over mass   D K  representative sections of deep margin and overlying mass from medial to lateral  L N  lateral radial margins  representative  O Q  representative sections of soft red cystic areas  mostly on the medial side of the mass  R W  additional representative sections of mass  V and U representative sections of fond like areas   X FF  representative sections of border between mass and surrounding adipose tissue  adipose tissue mobile over mass   EE and FF with adjacent skin   Resident  Cynthia E  Flynn  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  BREAST LEFT  MASTECTOMY  FAVOR PHYLLODES TUMOR  AWAIT PERMANENTS  O R  Resident  Lisa H  Lerner  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Asif Rashid  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SURGICAL DAY CARE   ACC 3 REPORTS TO  Frederick William Ackroyd  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   MASTECTOMIES   report_end  , Unchecked.
