 firm area extends to superior lateral inked soft tissue margins  Beneath the smaller scar is a 3 x 2 x 2cm irregular  stellate white  firm area with a central irregular cystic space filled with yellow friable material  This area is 0 5cm from the deep margin  The remaining breast parenchyma is composed of unremarkable lobulated adipose tissue and focal white tan breast parenchyma  The axillary tail portion contains three discrete nodules with solid white cut surfaces  the largest is 2cm  The nipple is unremarkable  SECTION CODE  A  The skin and underlying irregular area beneath the transverse incision  B F  Representative sections of the cystic area from medial to lateral  G H I  Representative axillary nodules  JandK  Representative tissue beneath the incision closer to the nipple  L   the deep margins  the smaller one beneath the cystic cavity  the larger one beneath the smaller incision  MandN  Representative breast parenchmya  O  Nipple and smaller incision  Resident  Metin Ozdemirli  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  AMBULATORY GEN SURGICAL   ACC 4 REPORTS TO  Herbert Charles Hoover Jr   M D  PART   RT BREAST   report_end  , Unchecked.
