rom the main lesion   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lateral end margin  en face  radially sectioned  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN  and  additional medial tissue   is an unoriented portion of tan yellow fatty tissue  measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm in aggregate  serially sectioned and submitted entirely in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN  and  superior final margin   are two unoriented tan yellow fatty tissue fragments that measure REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm in aggregate and is submitted entirely in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN  and  inferior final margin   are aggregates of unoriented tan yellow fatty tissue fragments that measure REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm in aggregate  The specimen is sectioned and submitted entirely in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN  and  lateral final margin   are aggregates of tan yellow unoriented fatty tissue fragments that measure REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm in aggregate  submitted entirely in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN  and  medial final margin   are aggregates of tan yellow unoriented fatty tissue fragments that measure REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm in aggregate  sectioned and submitted entirely in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   Wodzinski  REMOVE_MRN  and  sentinel node left axilla   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm fragment of unoriented tan yellow fatty tissue that is bivalved and entirely frozen as FX 1 and 1A  now resubmitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   respectively  INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS  FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1   1A  LYMPH NODE  SENTINEL NODE  LEFT AXILLA  CARCINOMA IS NOT IDENTIFIED  AWAIT SENTINEL NODE WORKUP  Final Diagnosis by Dennis Sgroi M D   Electr